<source xml:space="preserve" mq:segpart="73">The training of GPT-2 (a 1.5-billion-parameter model) in 2019 cost $50,000, while training of PaLM (a 540-billion-parameter model) in 2022 cost $8 million, and Megatron-Turing NLG 530B (in 2021) cost around $11 million.</source>
